,"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.75,"stats":{"hp":13000,"atk":900,"def":3500,"res":60,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"shadow_scholar":{"slug":"shadow_scholar","name":"Shadow Scholar","icon":"/enemies-icons/Shadow Scholar.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A character often seen in Yanese shadow plays, prone to strange encounters in those plays. This Shadowgeist has seen these scenes play out so many times that it believes them to be real, and even warning of the talismans is not enough to dissuade it.","abilities":["When HP drops below a certain level, absorbs a nearby <Talisman> and recovers HP"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.9,"stats":{"hp":13000,"atk":350,"def":50,"res":10,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":2}},"mirror_tianshi":{"slug":"mirror_tianshi","name":"Mirror Tianshi","icon":"/enemies-icons/Mirror Tianshi.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A well-polished mirror that believes it sees everything clearly. When it became a Geist, it was not content with just seeing things, but could not stop itself from giving unsolicited advice, just like the old scholars in the Tianshi Bureau.","abilities":["Picks a target from very long range, dealing Arts damage and sending a <Talisman>"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.4,"stats":{"hp":16000,"atk":300,"def":150,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":5}},"hexed_colossus":{"slug":"hexed_colossus","name":"Hexed Colossus","icon":"/enemies-icons/Hexed Colossus.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Arts Creation","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"This Originium construct, crafted by Mudrock, has been entwined with ancient Sarkaz witchcraft and now serves as an extension of its owner's will. The principle behind this Originium Art is quite obscure, but these constructs undoubtedly boast greater survivability and destructive power than normal Colossi.","abilities":[],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.4,"stats":{"hp":150000,"atk":3600,"def":800,"res":40,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":7}},"r_31a_heavy_power_armor":{"slug":"r_31a_heavy_power_armor","name":"R-31a Heavy Power Armor","icon":"/enemies-icons/R-31a Heavy Power Armor.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Machina","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A model that appeared around half a year ago among some mercenary groups, its performance is on par with mass-produced military models from five years ago. Technology is unregulated, so Columbians continue to seek greater efficiency within the bounds of the law.","abilities":["[Overload] Continuously deals Physical damage to the target proportional to the unit's ATK, andStuns the target"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.3,"stats":{"hp":32500,"atk":2000,"def":1500,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"big_adam":{"slug":"big_adam","name":"Big Adam","icon":"/enemies-icons/Big Adam.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"One of Reunion's squad leaders. He wears a heavy blast suit and attacks with an electric chainsaw. Bears a remarkable similarity to Big Bob, but does not appear to be the same person. It is unknown whether there is any relationship between the two of them. Data suggests that he may be even more dangerous than Big Bob. Due to his devastating attacks and extreme survivability, proceed with utmost caution.","abilities":[],"lev